            <!-- U1 RFID - TAB -->
            <div class="tab-pane" id="spmx-tab-spool-U1RFID">
                <p>
                    <small>
                        A <strong>Snapmaker U1</strong> running the paxx12 Extended Firmware reads RFID tags in
                        each of its four channels and can report them to SpoolManager. Channel N loads the spool
                        into tool N of <em>this</em> instance - it is not a hand scanner for other printers.
                        Read-only: nothing is ever written back to the printer.
                    </small>
