                                    <small class="help-block" style="margin-top: 4px; border-left: 2px solid #ddd; padding-left: 8px;">
                                        {{ _('No database id field, same as OpenPrintTag - matched back to a spool by the tag\'s own UID. A field whose value cannot be matched to a TigerTag id (e.g. an unlisted vendor) is left off the tag rather than guessed. Total weight and total length share one slot on the tag - weight wins if both are set.') }}
