                            <small>
                                <strong>{{ _('Extended') }}</strong> {{ _('writes every field OctoScale knows, including 1-3 colors plus transparent/rainbow, but needs NTAG215/216 - on NTAG213 the write fails outright rather than falling back.') }}<br>
                                <strong>{{ _('OpenSpool') }}</strong> {{ _('writes a standard NDEF/JSON record readable by generic phone NFC apps. A single opaque color.') }}<br>
                                <strong>{{ _('TigerTag') }}</strong> {{ _('writes TigerTag Standard (unsigned, open spec) - material, brand, aspect, diameter and weight unit as TigerTag\'s own ids, plus a single color, weight, and nozzle/bed temperature range. No database id (matched back to a spool by the tag\'s own UID, like OpenPrintTag). TigerTag+ (signed) is not supported.') }}
                            </small>
                        </span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="control-group">
